[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    117[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    118[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Two input classes that cannot be run to completion
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    119[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
